{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "dropdown-menu",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "interactive",
      "navigation",
      "action",
      "selection"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/dropdown-menu-docs"
    },
    "layer": "molecule",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [
        "scss/scss/06-molecules/_dropdown-menu.scss"
      ],
      "story": "stories/molecules/dropdown-menu.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/DropdownMenuArena.vue",
      "drupal": [],
      "docs": "docs/dropdown-menu-docs.html"
    }
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-dropdown"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "trigger",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__trigger",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "menu",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__menu",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "item",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__item",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "item-check",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__item-check",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "item-icon",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__item-icon",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "item-label",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__item-label",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "item-shortcut",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__item-shortcut",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "submenu-indicator",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__submenu-indicator",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "group",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__group",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "group-label",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__group-label",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "separator",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__separator",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "footer",
        "element": ".nc-dropdown__footer",
        "optional": true
      }
    ],
    "convenience": [],
    "domNotes": [
      "Root: inline-flex Wrapper mit Trigger-Button und Menu-Panel.",
      "Trigger: <button aria-haspopup='true' aria-expanded='true|false'>.",
      "Menu: position:absolute, role='menu'. Versteckt via [hidden].",
      "Positionierung: --bottom-start, --bottom-end, --top-start, --top-end Modifier. Empfehlung: Auto-Placement via Floating UI (computePosition + flip + shift + offset) fuer viewportabhaengige Positionierung. CSS-Modifier als Fallback fuer statische Anwendungsfaelle.",
      "Auto-Placement Pattern: import { computePosition, flip, shift, offset } from '@floating-ui/dom'; computePosition(trigger, menu, { placement: 'bottom-start', middleware: [offset(4), flip(), shift({ padding: 8 })] });",
      "Items: role='menuitem', flex-Layout mit gap fuer Check + Icon + Label + Shortcut + Submenu-Indicator.",
      "Checkable Items (single): role='menuitemradio', aria-checked='true|false'. Nur ein Item gleichzeitig checked. Check-Icon (Haekchen) links im Item, reservierte Spalte via .nc-dropdown--checkable.",
      "Checkable Items (multiple): role='menuitemcheckbox', aria-checked='true|false'. Mehrere Items gleichzeitig checked.",
      "Submenu: Parent-Item hat aria-haspopup='menu' + aria-expanded='true|false'. Submenu oeffnet sich rechts (LTR) oder links (RTL). Oeffnung via Hover (300ms Delay) oder ArrowRight. Schliessung via ArrowLeft oder Hover-out. Chevron-Icon (.nc-dropdown__submenu-indicator) zeigt Submenu-Existenz an.",
      "Footer: Permanenter Bereich am unteren Rand mit eigener Border-Top. Nicht scrollbar (sticky). Typisch: 'Alle anzeigen'-Link, Hilfetext, Aktions-Buttons.",
      "Danger-Item: Rote Farbe (feedback-danger), eigener Hover-BG.",
      "Icons: 16px, dekorativ. Shortcut: monospace, rechtsbuendig.",
      "Group-Label: uppercase, letter-spacing, user-select:none.",
      "Separator: border-top, horizontale Trennlinie zwischen Gruppen.",
      "Animation: fnd-dropdown-enter Keyframe, reduced-motion: none."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "placement": {
      "label": "Placement",
      "description": "Positionierung des Menues relativ zum Trigger — bottom-start (Standard), bottom-end, top-start, top-end. Empfehlung: Floating UI fuer dynamisches Auto-Placement.",
      "values": {
        "bottom-start": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "dropdown-bottom-start"
        },
        "bottom-end": {
          "modifier": "nc-dropdown__menu--bottom-end",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "dropdown-bottom-end"
        },
        "top-start": {
          "modifier": "nc-dropdown__menu--top-start",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "dropdown-top-start"
        },
        "top-end": {
          "modifier": "nc-dropdown__menu--top-end",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "dropdown-top-end"
        }
      }
    },
    "selectionMode": {
      "label": "Selection Mode",
      "description": "Auswahl-Modus: none (Standard, reine Aktionen), single (Radio-Auswahl, nur ein Item aktiv), multiple (Checkbox-Auswahl, mehrere Items aktiv)",
      "values": {
        "none": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "selection-none"
        },
        "single": {
          "modifier": "nc-dropdown--checkable",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "checkable"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "item-check": true
          },
          "renderHint": "selection-single"
        },
        "multiple": {
          "modifier": "nc-dropdown--checkable",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "checkable"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "item-check": true
          },
          "renderHint": "selection-multiple"
        }
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "label": "Content",
      "description": "Inhaltsvariante — plain (nur Items), with-icons (Items mit Icons), grouped (Items in Gruppen mit Label + Separator), with-shortcuts (Items mit Tastaturkuerzel), with-submenu (Items mit Submenu-Indikator), with-footer (permanenter Footer-Bereich)",
      "values": {
        "plain": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "dropdown-plain"
        },
        "with-icons": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "item-icon": true
          },
          "renderHint": "dropdown-with-icons"
        },
        "grouped": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "group": true,
            "group-label": true,
            "separator": true
          },
          "renderHint": "dropdown-grouped"
        },
        "with-shortcuts": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "item-shortcut": true
          },
          "renderHint": "dropdown-with-shortcuts"
        },
        "with-submenu": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "submenu"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "submenu-indicator": true
          },
          "renderHint": "dropdown-with-submenu"
        },
        "with-footer": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "footer"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "footer": true
          },
          "renderHint": "dropdown-with-footer"
        }
      }
    },
    "itemVariant": {
      "label": "Item Variant",
      "description": "Variante des einzelnen Items — default (neutral), danger (destruktive Aktion)",
      "values": {
        "default": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "item-default"
        },
        "danger": {
          "modifier": "nc-dropdown__item--danger",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "item-danger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "hover",
      "active",
      "focus",
      "disabled",
      "checked"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "disabled",
      "focus",
      "active",
      "checked",
      "hover",
      "default"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "hover",
        "unless": [
          "disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Hover: bg-hover auf dem Item. Nicht bei Disabled."
      },
      {
        "state": "active",
        "unless": [
          "disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Active: bg-active auf dem Item (Klick-Feedback)."
      },
      {
        "state": "focus",
        "unless": [
          "disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Focus: focus-ring auf dem Item via :focus-visible."
      },
      {
        "state": "disabled",
        "unless": [],
        "note": "Disabled: color-disabled, pointer-events: none, cursor: default."
      },
      {
        "state": "checked",
        "unless": [
          "disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Checked: Check-Icon sichtbar (opacity:1), font-weight:medium. Nur bei selectionMode single/multiple."
      }
    ],
    "interactive": true
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": true,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
      "assertions": [
        "hasAccessibleName",
        "supportsKeyboard"
      ],
      "note": "Trigger: aria-haspopup='true', aria-expanded='true|false'. Menu: role='menu'. Items: role='menuitem'. Keyboard: ArrowUp/Down navigiert, Enter/Space aktiviert, Escape schliesst. Focus auf erstes Item beim Oeffnen."
    },
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "states": [
            "disabled"
          ]
        },
        "suggest": [
          "aria-disabled"
        ],
        "note": "Disabled Items: aria-disabled='true' oder disabled-Attribut. Nicht fokussierbar."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "itemVariant": [
              "danger"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [],
        "note": "Danger-Items: Farbe allein ist kein Signal — Label muss die destruktive Aktion beschreiben (z.B. 'Loeschen')."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "selectionMode": [
              "single"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "role-menuitemradio",
          "aria-checked"
        ],
        "note": "Single-Select: Items muessen role='menuitemradio' und aria-checked='true|false' haben. Screen Reader meldet 'Radiobutton, aktiviert'."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "selectionMode": [
              "multiple"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "role-menuitemcheckbox",
          "aria-checked"
        ],
        "note": "Multi-Select: Items muessen role='menuitemcheckbox' und aria-checked='true|false' haben. Screen Reader meldet 'Kontrollkaestchen, aktiviert'."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "content": [
              "with-submenu"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "aria-haspopup-menu",
          "aria-expanded"
        ],
        "note": "Submenu-Item: aria-haspopup='menu', aria-expanded='true|false'. Keyboard: ArrowRight oeffnet Submenu, ArrowLeft/Escape schliesst es."
      }
    ]
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "aria-haspopup",
          "aria-expanded"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Trigger braucht aria-haspopup='true' und aria-expanded State."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "role-menu",
          "role-menuitem"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Menu: role='menu'. Items: role='menuitem'. Keyboard-Navigation erforderlich."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "selectionMode": [
              "single"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "role-menuitemradio",
          "aria-checked"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Single-Select: role='menuitemradio' + aria-checked auf jedem checkbaren Item."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "selectionMode": [
              "multiple"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "role-menuitemcheckbox",
          "aria-checked"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Multi-Select: role='menuitemcheckbox' + aria-checked auf jedem checkbaren Item."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "content": [
              "with-submenu"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-haspopup-menu"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Submenu-Items brauchen aria-haspopup='menu' + aria-expanded."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "copy": {
      "triggerLabel": {
        "maxChars": 40,
        "note": "Trigger braucht sichtbares Label oder aria-label (z.B. 'Aktionen', 'Mehr Optionen')."
      },
      "itemLabel": {
        "maxChars": 60,
        "note": "Item-Label: Kurz, aktionsbasiert. Beginnt mit Verb (z.B. 'Bearbeiten', 'Loeschen', 'Exportieren')."
      }
    }
  },
  "styling": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-dropdown"
    ],
    "baseTokenGroups": [
      "container",
      "item",
      "item-danger",
      "group",
      "separator"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "container": {
        "label": "Container",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dropdown-bg",
          "nc-dropdown-border",
          "nc-dropdown-border-width",
          "nc-dropdown-radius",
          "nc-dropdown-shadow",
          "nc-dropdown-padding",
          "nc-dropdown-min-width",
          "nc-dropdown-max-height",
          "nc-dropdown-z-index",
          "nc-dropdown-animation-duration"
        ]
      },
      "item": {
        "label": "Item",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dropdown-item-height",
          "nc-dropdown-item-padding",
          "nc-dropdown-item-radius",
          "nc-dropdown-item-color",
          "nc-dropdown-item-bg-hover",
          "nc-dropdown-item-bg-active",
          "nc-dropdown-item-color-disabled",
          "nc-dropdown-item-icon-size",
          "nc-dropdown-item-icon-color",
          "nc-dropdown-item-gap",
          "nc-dropdown-item-font-size",
          "nc-dropdown-item-font-weight"
        ]
      },
      "item-danger": {
        "label": "Danger Item",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dropdown-item-danger-color",
          "nc-dropdown-item-danger-bg-hover"
        ]
      },
      "checkable": {
        "label": "Checkable Items",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dropdown-check-size",
          "nc-dropdown-check-color",
          "nc-dropdown-check-gap"
        ]
      },
      "submenu": {
        "label": "Submenu",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dropdown-submenu-indicator-size",
          "nc-dropdown-submenu-indicator-color",
          "nc-dropdown-submenu-offset"
        ]
      },
      "footer": {
        "label": "Footer",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dropdown-footer-padding",
          "nc-dropdown-footer-bg",
          "nc-dropdown-footer-border-color"
        ]
      },
      "group": {
        "label": "Group Label",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dropdown-group-label-color",
          "nc-dropdown-group-label-size",
          "nc-dropdown-group-label-weight",
          "nc-dropdown-group-label-padding"
        ]
      },
      "separator": {
        "label": "Separator",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dropdown-separator-color",
          "nc-dropdown-separator-margin"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "recipes": {
    "mode": "derived",
    "derive": {
      "from": [
        "axes",
        "states",
        "styling.tokenGroups"
      ],
      "output": [
        "classList",
        "resolvedTokens",
        "a11yAssertions"
      ]
    },
    "resolution": {
      "classList": [
        "styling.baseClasses",
        "axes.placement.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.selectionMode.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.content.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.itemVariant.values.*.modifier"
      ],
      "tokenGroups": [
        "styling.baseTokenGroups",
        "axes.*.values.*.tokenGroups"
      ]
    }
  },
  "specimens": [
    {
      "id": "all-states",
      "label": "All States",
      "description": "Dropdown-Item in allen Zustaenden: default, hover, active, focus, disabled",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "placement": [
            "bottom-start"
          ],
          "selectionMode": [
            "none"
          ],
          "content": [
            "plain"
          ],
          "itemVariant": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "hover",
          "active",
          "focus",
          "disabled"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "{state}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Item-Text 4.5:1 gegen Menu-BG. Focus-Ring sichtbar. Hover/Active BG-Wechsel. Disabled: text-disabled Farbe."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "placement-variants",
      "label": "Placement Variants",
      "description": "Alle vier Positionierungen: bottom-start, bottom-end, top-start, top-end",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "placement": "*",
          "selectionMode": [
            "none"
          ],
          "content": [
            "plain"
          ],
          "itemVariant": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "placement"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{placement}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Positionierung aendert nur die CSS-Position, keine A11y-Auswirkung."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "content-variants",
      "label": "Content Variants",
      "description": "Plain, With Icons, Grouped, With Shortcuts, With Submenu, With Footer",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "placement": [
            "bottom-start"
          ],
          "selectionMode": [
            "none"
          ],
          "content": "*",
          "itemVariant": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "content"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{content}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Icons dekorativ (aria-hidden). Shortcuts: rein visuell. Group-Label: nicht fokussierbar. Footer: fokussierbare Links/Buttons."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "checkable-single",
      "label": "Single Select (Radio)",
      "description": "Radio-Auswahl: Nur ein Item gleichzeitig aktiv. role='menuitemradio', aria-checked.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "placement": [
            "bottom-start"
          ],
          "selectionMode": [
            "single"
          ],
          "content": [
            "plain"
          ],
          "itemVariant": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "checked"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "dropdown-checkable-single",
        "label": "single-select"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Items: role='menuitemradio'. Check-Icon dekorativ (aria-hidden). aria-checked steuert Screen-Reader-Ausgabe."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "checkable-multiple",
      "label": "Multi Select (Checkbox)",
      "description": "Checkbox-Auswahl: Mehrere Items gleichzeitig aktiv. role='menuitemcheckbox', aria-checked.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "placement": [
            "bottom-start"
          ],
          "selectionMode": [
            "multiple"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-icons"
          ],
          "itemVariant": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "checked"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "dropdown-checkable-multiple",
        "label": "multi-select"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Items: role='menuitemcheckbox'. Mehrere Items koennen gleichzeitig aria-checked='true' haben."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "with-submenu",
      "label": "Submenu (Cascading)",
      "description": "Item mit Submenu-Indikator (Chevron rechts). Submenu oeffnet sich bei Hover/ArrowRight.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "placement": [
            "bottom-start"
          ],
          "selectionMode": [
            "none"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-submenu"
          ],
          "itemVariant": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "dropdown-submenu",
        "label": "cascading-menu"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Submenu-Item: aria-haspopup='menu', aria-expanded. Keyboard: ArrowRight oeffnet, ArrowLeft/Escape schliesst."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "with-footer",
      "label": "Footer Slot",
      "description": "Permanenter Footer-Bereich am unteren Rand — z.B. 'Alle anzeigen' Link oder Hilfetext.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "placement": [
            "bottom-start"
          ],
          "selectionMode": [
            "none"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-footer"
          ],
          "itemVariant": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "dropdown-footer",
        "label": "footer-slot"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Footer-Inhalt (Links, Buttons) muss fokussierbar sein. Tab-Reihenfolge: Items → Footer."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "danger-item",
      "label": "Danger Item",
      "description": "Destruktive Aktion (z.B. Loeschen) mit roter Farbe und eigenem Hover-BG",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "placement": [
            "bottom-start"
          ],
          "selectionMode": [
            "none"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-icons"
          ],
          "itemVariant": [
            "danger"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "hover"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "danger-{state}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Danger-Farbe muss 4.5:1 gegen Menu-BG. Danger-Hover-BG (background-danger) 3:1. Farbe nie alleiniges Signal."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "grouped-with-danger",
      "label": "Grouped with Danger",
      "description": "Typisches Kontextmenue: Gruppen mit normalen und destruktiven Aktionen",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "placement": [
            "bottom-start"
          ],
          "selectionMode": [
            "none"
          ],
          "content": [
            "grouped"
          ],
          "itemVariant": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
